<title>HUNGARY: Hungagent swings to profit in 1996.</title>
<headline>Hungagent swings to profit in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group operating result	  17.1 profit  vs     18.3 loss</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax result	    23.0 profit  vs     51.9 loss</p>
<p>    Group net sales		  388.1	   vs    249.7</p>
<p>     Group foreign sales	     0	     vs	4.7</p>
<p>     Group domestic sales	  388.1	   vs    245.0</p>
<p>    Group material expenditures  258.9	   vs    156.5</p>
<p>    Group personnel costs	   56.3	   vs     58.5</p>
<p>    Group depreciation		23.7	   vs     23.5</p>
<p>    Group other costs		 20.6	   vs     29.3</p>
<p>    Group other expenditures	32.1	   vs     15.3</p>
<p>    Group financial result	  15.2 loss    vs     42.7 loss</p>
<p>    Group extraordinary result    21.1	   vs	9.2</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures for 1996 are consolidated and unaudited, while 1995 figures are consolidated and audited. Hungagent Rt is an assets management company.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
